Python language bindigs for uni-json JSON parser/ serializer.

Provides functions for parsing a JSON string to turn it into a Python data structure
and for serializing a Python data structure into a JSON string. Based on the
following mapping of Python types to JSON types:

	Python		JSON
        ----------------------
        dict		object
        list		array
        str		string
        int/ float	number
        True		true
        False		false
        None		null
